cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the archived release."
title: "PlantLumen reconstructs plant spatial gene expression from histology via intraspecies retrieval and quantifies gene predictability"
abstract: >-
  Reference-assisted prediction of spatial gene expression from plant histology
  images. One frozen architecture is applied independently to each species: the
  feature transform, the reference bank and the expression subspace are
  estimated inside a species and a fold, from training sections only.
type: software
license: MIT
